package cajeta.aot;

/**
 * Declares a test double in the compile-time DI graph. Under `--profile=test`
 * the class is included and masks every non-test @Component that implements an
 * interface this double also implements — the double takes over that
 * interface's @Inject sites (AspectModel.md § "Profiles and test-component
 * masking"). Masking is interface-scoped: a double with no interface masks
 * nothing (it is injectable only by its own concrete type). Outside test mode,
 * @TestComponent classes are dropped from the graph.
 *
 * Core: recognized and lowered by the compiler like @Component.
 */
annotation TestComponent {
}
